Or, you could take an archaeologist for a spin.  They are much easier
for a beginner to play, since they start out with speed and something
else (searching?), and have better stats.  They also start with 3-5 food
rations or so.  Finally, they also start with a pick axe (useful for
robbing vaults and other assorted purposes) and a tinning kit (get that
blessed up and you're in business).

